      <name>Fazer Geisha 121g bar</name>
      <category>Chocolate</category>
      <info>Ingredients: Socker, mjölk, kakaosmör, hasselnötter (11%), kakaomassa, helmjölkspulver, kärnmjölkspulver, vetemjöl, majsstärkelse, emulgeringsmedel (sojalecitin), solrosolja, salt, aromer. Kan innehålla andra nötter, mandlar och andra spannmål som innehåller gluten. Mjölkchokladen innehåller minst 30% kakao.
Confidence: high
Values based on full nutrition label and translated ingredient list. Major macros (fat, carbs, protein, sugars) are directly from the label. Cocoa fat and solids estimated from milk chocolate (min 30% cocoa), with cocoa butter and cocoa mass present. Butterfat and MSNF estimated from milk powders and milk chocolate content. Fiber from cocoa and hazelnuts. Sugars mostly sucrose (from sugar and chocolate), with some lactose (milk), glucose/fructose (minor from cocoa, milk, and possible invert sugar). Starch from wheat flour and corn starch. Ash, minerals, and salt estimated from typical chocolate and ingredient list. No sugar alcohols or alcohol present. Confidence high due to detailed label and ingredient list.</info>
