      <name>Arla vispgrädde, 40%</name>
      <category>Dairy</category>
      <info>Cream with 40% fat
Confidence: high
Arla vispgrädde 40% is Swedish heavy cream with 40% milk fat. Standard values for 40% cream: ~2g protein, ~3g lactose (all sugars are lactose), ~0.6g ash, ~0.02mg vitamin D, ~90mg calcium, ~120mg potassium, ~0.03g sodium per 100g. All fat is butterfat. No fiber, sugar alcohol, or starch. MSNF = protein + lactose + ash. No added sugars. Saturated and trans fat typical for dairy fat. No cocoa or plant components.</info>
